# "the number of opponents you attacked this turn" (CR 508.1, 701.15a): after a turn in which Bot1 attacked both opponents,
# the next turn it attacks Bot2 alone, so X is 1 - the earlier turn's attacks are not this turn's - and a second target is
# refused.

[Bot1 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mountain x3
Galvanizing Tenor
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

[Bot3 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

[Actions]
[T1 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
